From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a page's screen capture goes through the desktop's
 portal

The engine is the Wayland desktop, so it runs with no WAYLAND_DISPLAY.
webrtc's IsRunningUnderWayland() requires it, so no screen capturer was
made and getDisplayMedia() found no screen.

CreateScreenCapturer makes webrtc's PipeWire capturer whenever PipeWire
is built in, asking the portal to embed the pointer. It asks the
desktop's ScreenCast portal when capture starts; the shell draws its
picker of windows, monitors and regions. Every caller gets it, which in
the engine is a page's getDisplayMedia().

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 content/public/browser/desktop_capture.cc | 14 ++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/content/public/browser/desktop_capture.cc b/content/public/browser/desktop_capture.cc
index 070c3b8..c07c214 100644
--- a/content/public/browser/desktop_capture.cc
+++ b/content/public/browser/desktop_capture.cc
@@ -29,6 +29,7 @@
 #if defined(WEBRTC_USE_PIPEWIRE)
 #include "base/environment.h"
 #include "base/nix/xdg_util.h"
+#include "third_party/webrtc/modules/desktop_capture/linux/wayland/base_capturer_pipewire.h"
 #endif
 
 #if BUILDFLAG(IS_WIN)
@@ -89,11 +90,20 @@ std::unique_ptr<webrtc::DesktopCapturer> CreateScreenCapturer(
   }
 #endif  // BUILDFLAG(IS_CHROMEOS)
 
-#if BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID)
+#if defined(WEBRTC_USE_PIPEWIRE)
+  // Domicile: the engine is the Wayland desktop, so it runs with no
+  // WAYLAND_DISPLAY, which webrtc's IsRunningUnderWayland() requires. Every
+  // screen comes from the desktop's ScreenCast portal, whose picker also
+  // offers windows and regions. The portal draws the pointer into the frames:
+  // webrtc's cursor monitor has the same WAYLAND_DISPLAY check.
+  options.set_prefer_cursor_embedded(true);
+  return std::make_unique<webrtc::BaseCapturerPipeWire>(
+      options, webrtc::CaptureType::kAnyScreenContent);
+#elif BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID)
   return std::make_unique<DesktopCapturerAndroid>(options);
 #else
   return webrtc::DesktopCapturer::CreateScreenCapturer(options);
-#endif  // BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID)
+#endif
 }
 
 std::unique_ptr<webrtc::DesktopCapturer> CreateWindowCapturer(
